</pre></td> --><td class="rouge-code"><pre><span class="n">source</span> <span class="s1">'https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/git/CocoaPods/Specs.git'</span>
</pre></td></tr></tbody></table></code></pre></div></div>

